  "commentaries": [
    {
      "commentary_id": "lunyu_zhuxi:1.1",
      "target_passage_id": "lunyu:1.1",
      "commentator": "朱熹",
      "commentary_dynasty": "南宋",
      "commentary_text": "学之为言效也。人性皆善，而觉有先后，后觉者必效先觉之所为，乃可以明善而复其初也。习，鸟数飞也。学之不已，如鸟数飞也。说，喜意也。既学而又时时习之，则所学者熟，而中心喜说，其进自不能已矣。程子曰：「以善及人，而信从者众，故可乐。」愠，含怒意。君子，成德之名。尹氏曰：「学在己，知不知在人，何愠之有。」",
      "text_type": "commentary",
      "source_id": "src_unknown",
      "source_provider": "unknown",
      "source_url": "unknown",
      "source_edition": "unknown",
      "license": "unknown",
      "verification_level": "C",
      "proofread_status": "unproofread",
      "verified_by": null,
      "verified_at": null,
      "embedding_version": null
    },
    {
      "commentary_id": "lunyu_zhuxi:1.4",
      "target_passage_id": "lunyu:1.4",
      "commentator": "朱熹",
      "commentary_dynasty": "南宋",
      "commentary_text": "省，察也。忠，尽己之谓。信，以实之谓。传，谓受之于师。习，谓熟之于己。曾子以此三者日省其身，有则改之，无则加勉，其自治诚切如此，可谓得为学之本矣。",
      "text_type": "commentary",
      "source_id": "src_unknown",
      "source_provider": "unknown",
      "source_url": "unknown",
      "source_edition": "unknown",
      "license": "unknown",
      "verification_level": "C",
      "proofread_status": "unproofread",
      "verified_by": null,
      "verified_at": null,
      "embedding_version": null
    },
    {
      "commentary_id": "lunyu_zhuxi:2.4",
      "target_passage_id": "lunyu:2.4",
      "commentator": "朱熹",
      "commentary_dynasty": "南宋",
      "commentary_text": "志于学，谓志乎大学之道也。立，谓固执其所学而不可夺。不惑，谓于事物之所当然皆无所疑。知天命，谓知天道流行之命。耳顺，谓声入心通，无所违逆。从心所欲不逾矩，谓随其心之所欲，而自不过于法度。此圣人始终本末之序，学者不可以不知也。",
      "text_type": "commentary",
      "source_id": "src_unknown",
      "source_provider": "unknown",
      "source_url": "unknown",
      "source_edition": "unknown",
      "license": "unknown",
      "verification_level": "C",
      "proofread_status": "unproofread",
      "verified_by": null,
      "verified_at": null,
      "embedding_version": null
    },
    {
      "commentary_id": "lunyu_zhuxi:2.11",
      "target_passage_id": "lunyu:2.11",
      "commentator": "朱熹",
      "commentary_dynasty": "南宋",
      "commentary_text": "温，寻绎也。故者，旧所闻。新者，今所得。言学能时习旧闻，而每有新得，则所学在我，而其应不穷，故可以为人师。若夫记问之学，则无得于心，而所知有限，故不可以为师。",
      "text_type": "commentary",
      "source_id": "src_unknown",
      "source_provider": "unknown",
      "source_url": "unknown",
      "source_edition": "unknown",
      "license": "unknown",
      "verification_level": "C",
      "proofread_status": "unproofread",
      "verified_by": null,
      "verified_at": null,
      "embedding_version": null
    },
    {
      "commentary_id": "lunyu_zhuxi:2.15",
      "target_passage_id": "lunyu:2.15",
      "commentator": "朱熹",
      "commentary_dynasty": "南宋",
      "commentary_text": "不求诸心，故昏而无得。不习其事，故危而不安。程子曰：「博学之，审问之，慎思之，明辨之，笃行之，五者废其一，非学也。」",
      "text_type": "commentary",
      "source_id": "src_unknown",
